OL,3,GNEWSABus driver 'gutted' to be retiring
OL,4,Aafter 60 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA bus driver said he is "gutted" to be
OL,7,Fretiring after serving the same routes
OL,8,Ffor 60 years.
OL,10,FJimmy Kewley, from Birkenhead, Wirral,
OL,11,FMerseyside, started working as a
OL,12,Fconductor aged 18 before he was old
OL,13,Fenough to get a license to drive at 21.
OL,15,FNow, aged 78, he said he was left
OL,16,F"devastated" after his doctor told him
OL,17,Fhe had a heart condition as he would
OL,18,Fhave to give up the job he loved.
OL,20,F"I knew once my doctor had written on
OL,21,Fthe sick note 'suspected half
OL,22,Ffailure'," he said.
